<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">2PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">2PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">2PE - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Nga Siman Biturus, igen ben ne na Yesɔ Kristi ndum,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Mcɛr zhin abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛme ne ki didik iyi Arik amɔr ben ne ta ta zhɔk Yesɔ Kristi iwaŋ ndi iwa ne tanyɛme maa ne nek ta didik tanyɛme ndi mɔr:<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ita zhɔk ye Arik ben isɔŋ kɛ sik bǝ yi min shaga ne izhi kɛ Arik ben Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijɔ ye Arik ben hria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Tǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik ne nek ta kɔte nii ndi ta wɔ bǝ ne sɔŋ mɔr ben na gli Arik ne asusun ne Mgbemgbeb kɛ waŋ ndi ne zhɔ ta ne ŋgɔŋ ben na didik maa. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Nǝ na yiŋɛ, Arik ne nek ta kiki ngɔngɔŋ maa bǝn iyi baŋ susun didik ndi ne kpai aŋyak, te duŋ ne atu mǝne izhin bǝ yime ne miŋ kɛ sen yi kpa te lieru ne kpa kɛ lalɛ kǝkɛŋ ndi shetan atur kiki iyi duŋ aneshir ate bubu mɔ.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ne atu ki yiŋɛ, nek tu mi te na ki ndi iduŋu tanyɛme mi bǝ yi didik; te ididik mi, izhi mi; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ben vuŋ kpa, ivuŋ susun; te zǝ Arik ŋgɔŋ; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />naa amunya iki didik; te bɛ na ta nyɛmɛ ne akpa. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ate yi ndi kiki iyi bla yiŋɛ uyime neyi tena nai ŋgɔŋ, itei duŋu klik ne nkɔŋ kɛ izhi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ama atei ndi inuŋ ba yime neyi ba, ayi ndi ner ndi ba yik gbagbaŋ ba tena yi amfik, te aŋur asuk ne ir keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne ŋlau lalɛ maa yi kukub.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Neme, amunya, izhin bɛ shur ayi ŋgɔŋ te duŋ ijɔ mine ben ir keŋ ndi Arik ne hria zhin bǝ yi anenen. Ndi izhin te zǝ kiki yiŋɛ, ba zhin tei zhaku ne tanyɛme mi ba, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />fe Arik atei ta zhin aŋɔk ayaa ne kɔb ŋgɔŋ kɛ shu ndi Ŋgɔŋ ine ta ta zhɔk Yesɔ Kristi iwa atei gli iyaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Fena M tei ben shu zhin kiki yiŋɛ, Mne zhi izhin ne zhi tena zhik ne kɛ zub ndi iyi anenen. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Myik irɛ tem nduŋ zhin bǝ shuzhi te mnak ri yime tsitsir ne kpa kǝŋe, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />tem mne nzhi te bai baŋ mkpaŋ ba mbaŋ tu yaŋa, ndi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi ne tsar me ndende. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Fe M tei na kɔte nii tem yik mte kam goŋ yaŋa ba zhin tei ŋursuk ne kiki yiŋɛ ba.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ yik ŋgɔŋ kɛ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Taba abɛ na ndum Yesɔ Kristi me ba tane bla zhin lɛ kɛ duk ijɔm ba kɔ kai Mgbemgbeb kɛ atu amɔr ba, ama ta bla zhin ki yiŋ ndi tane yik ne ayi amɔr te Yesɔ Kristi atei nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ maa. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Fena tane yi amɔ ndi ne ta ilɛk gli bǝn ŋgɔŋ ire bǝn Arik Tetɛɛ ndi ikɔr ne nyɛ netu maa ire Shu Ŋgɔŋ, te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ai Zumuŋ, ai wa Mtanyɛme; ben wa Myi ne zhɔk susun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Taba mɔr yime tane wɔ kɔr keŋ ndi ne re shu ndi tane yi ben Yesɔ ne tu gbu tsetser.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Fena taba ne tanyɛme ne nkanlɛ yi aner abɛ Arik, te duŋ izhin bǝ klɛ anenen ne tsara, ndi ilaŋ amkpa ne miŋ kɛ bu, imla ne ŋan bɛr te duŋ cinces ye amblimblɛ bǝ laŋ yir miŋ asusun amin. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Nǝ klɛ tu, izhin bǝ zhi te abaŋ ndi ne bla nek ilɛ kɛ Arik bai Mgbemgbeb kinuŋ kɛ nek izhi ilɛmɛ ba ai nek iyi tɔ ti ne lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Tǝ bla tɔ ti ba yi ne mkpaŋ tiŋ ba ne na iyi neshir, ama aner abaŋ ndi Arik wa ne anǝk ba Izhu Tsetser maa.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Abɛ bla tsar mu ben cɔk kiki la men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Neme abɛ bla mu te aba yi abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ne miŋ kɛ aneshir, ndi anuŋ atei na yi amɛ ne miŋ min. Atei lɔm aner te bu alɛla ane zǝr ba te bɛ tun izhi Yesɔ ndi ne ku te na kam lu ne atu ayi lalɛ mɔr, atei zǝr atu amen ahrie. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Aneshir abɛ zǝ Arik tetɛk atei zǝ tsar men ne ŋkuŋkɔŋ iyi shisha te ai gli itsar yi lɛ didik atibe ne asusun abɛ kyak tanyɛme ne lɛ didik te wɔb duk ijɔm. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Nǝ miŋ kɛ timu mǝne atei duk zhin ijɔm ndi ne ŋlɔi. Ililɛ mǝne ne akɔrǝ asak ba, fe bai kam iber yi zǝr bama ba.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ate yi ndi Arik bane duŋ abɛ bla shar maa ne lalɛ men ba, te tur ba kɔmɔ ne miŋ dudu lu kɛ te buu, te kpa ba shur aŋub bɛr yi ŋas; <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />te Arik ba te duŋ aner abɛ gɔŋmimi abɛ kukub ba te duŋ amashir anca aŋgɔŋ avu abɛ kyak zǝ lɛ maa adɔmɔ, te duŋ Nuhu wa, ine bla lɛ didik, ben aner abɛ kɔ maa amɛ ataŋgba; <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />ate yi ndi Arik ane goŋ ntun ŋgɔŋ iyi Sodɔm bǝn Gomɔra ate ntɔŋ, te duŋ ba abɛ yik te zhi iki ndi itei vuŋ abɛ kyak ta lɛ kɛ Arik; <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />fena te yi ndi Arik ate ta Lot azhɔk, iner tsetser, iwaŋ ndi bane tik ayi ne kiki iyi bubu ye ner abɛ klik tu ba <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />te Ilɔt iner tsetser yuŋɔ, ne sɔŋ ne miŋ mǝne, ne yik iyah ne aŋɔk abɛ kyak na didik Ilɔt ne yik tena wɔ <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />iyiŋɛ te yi amɛ, fena Arik Ŋgɔŋ ne zhi ir keŋ ndi wai gli aner abɛ zeu arumɔ bǝn abaŋ ndi ana kiki iyi nyɛr maa, ne miŋ kɛ iyik iyah men te Arik abɛ kpa abɛ lalɛ aŋyak aŋub bɛr yi ŋas, te bɛ zen yik iyah men. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Waŋa ai lɛ didik ndi aner abɛ zǝ bubu yi kpa kɛ lalɛ te kyak ilɛ kɛ nek Arik.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Aŋur asa te lɛ lǝlɛ mimin netu lɛ kɛ Arik iyaŋ klu sisik iye aner abɛ shar Arik ndi aklik anaŋ ba te ana yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ anaŋ ba ne ti kɛ Arik; <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />neme kɔ te vuŋ abɛ shar amaa, ne ye me abɛ shara aklik tena ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ anaŋ abɛ tsar imumɔ, ba lɛ mla netu kiki iyi na Arik ba. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ama aner abɛ tsar imumɔ atimu ne atu yi kiki ndi bane zhi ba. Te naga yi ndi inarum ne yaŋ zhi ki, iyi na Arik neme Arik atei zǝr ba adɔmɔ ndi inarumɔ.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Atei ya ba kiki iyi na mǝne ne yik iyah netu ki ndi ne nai. Te yik te aba abɛ kpur abɛ yaŋ klik teduŋ ba abɛ zhaku te zǝ ba ali kili, te gbur iyaŋ sɔŋ keke aku bama. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Ayi amene atei bu ŋgon netu abubu yi wɔb kur ben amba, te kyak duŋ na zumimiŋe; atei zǝb aza abɛ yaŋ klik ne atu bubu ndi neka zhaku ne tanyɛme men! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Neka duŋ ankɔŋ adidik te dur adɔ te akama zekur Balaam izu Biyo, iwaŋ ndi anyɛr ki yi na mimin. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Fena Arik ne duŋ tatur ndi ba lɛ ba agbaŋu atɔŋ ne ki mimin iyi na maa ne kɔr kɛ neshir.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Anere abɛ tsar mu abaŋa ayi ndi angyak atuk ayi yaŋ amashir tena yi ndi mgbumgbuk abuda ndi ŋguŋgu ngɔŋ fugǝ. Arik nena amantib bu aŋyak aŋub ba. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Aŋur asa ne kǝŋkɛn lǝlɛ yi ti mu men ndi, aruk aner ayayas abɛ ta Arik te bɛ na kiki mimin ndi aner abɛ na zumimiŋ azǝn na, watɔ kiki bubu iyi baŋ asusun aneshir. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Abɛ tsar mumɔ ne kpa anyak ba tedi aba atei zuk ba shur ne miŋ kɛ yi ne agɛn men, te ŋur asuk te aba menyi ayi ne miŋ kɛ na gen kɛ zen lalɛ, amɛ neshir waŋ ndi ne shur zhɔk susun ne ki yi gɔŋ mimi inaŋ Arik ayi gen neyi me. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ka abɛ di abɛ tsar mu abaŋa ne lieru ne ki mimin yi na mǝne te zhi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr bǝn Nǝ ta ta zhɔk Yesɔ Kristi te akam duŋ ilalɛ mǝne tsǝ ba nyak ne klɛtu inaŋ yi ku ti me, ne na mimin. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ibɛre te aner abaŋa ai bɛ zhi ankɔŋ ayou Arik ane na didik, naŋ yiŋ ndi ne zhiu te akam agɔŋ ne nkanlɛ yi nek Arik. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Tǝ aneshir ne di nkan lǝlɛ ne tu amene: &lt;&lt;Iviu akama lak iklɔk maa,&gt;&gt; neme, &lt;&lt;Agluk ane kɔb ate ŋlau kpa maa atei na kama kɔmɔ ne ancam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Iber yi nyɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Nga Biturus mcɛr zhin akpa amuŋ, waŋa ayi mplɛ kɛ yaa ndi mcɛr zhin. Mne ncɛrǝ yayaa ma te izhin bǝ shuzhi te zhin bǝ lu klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne kiki ndi mne bla zhin neyi. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Mdi izhin bǝ shuzhi nkan lǝlɛ yi ŋgɔŋ ndi tsetser aner abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik kukub ane bla kɛ ne di iyiŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ amɔr ine ta ta zhɔk ane nek abɛ na ndum maa.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Iki zhin bɔbɔk, izhin tei na zhi te ne bɛr yi nyɛ klɛtu aneshir abɛ na kiki mimin atei nyɛ, te zǝ kiki mimin iyi bubu. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Atei rib, &lt;&lt;Iki yiŋɛ iye ni &lt;I nyɛ&gt; te Yesɔ ne kpai aŋyak te Iwa atei kama nyɛi? Ire kukub ndi antsintsim amɔr neka ku, ikinuŋ ba ne sen ba baŋ rɛ mkpaŋ kɛ na goŋ mimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Fena ne ŋur asuk ne ŋyak te ire kukub Arik ne nek ilɛ kɛ ndi gbarshu ne yime tena na gɔŋmimi asak ne amashir ben amashir. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Ne amashir ayiŋɛ menyi gɔŋmimi kɛ mkpaŋa Arik ne zǝr aneshire adɔmɔ ne anca ngoŋ. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Nǝ ir nkanlɛ zhin ishu kɛ azizaŋa ben gɔŋmimi ne kam ba aŋyak abɛ goŋ ne lu, ndi Arik ne kam ba aŋyak aŋub bɛr yi te ŋas bǝn aner abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik adɔmɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ama izhineba akpa amuŋ, kǝr zhin bǝ ŋursuk ne ki zhiin iyiŋɛ ba: Bǝn Arik iber zhiin iyi ndi ase azhin azhiin, ne me ase azhin azhiin ayi ndi iber zhiin <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Arik ba sik kpa ne yaŋ na ki ndi ne akpai aŋyak, ir keŋ ndi anuŋ azhi abɛ sik kpa. Arik avuŋ susun ben abɛ zhin, bane tanyɛme te inuŋ ne miŋ min abɛ naŋ adɔ, ama kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ nyɛ ben zuk ne lalɛ maa.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Fena iber iyi nyɛ Arik itei yi ndi iyir ner ne zhib. Igbar shu itei naŋadɔ ne gwu ŋgɔŋ; ncinces ben nki ki iyi ku dɔ ne gbarshu itei goŋ ne lu, fe gɔŋmimi ben iki yiŋ ndi iyi ne miŋe itei naŋ dɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Ate yi ndi kɔte nii atei goŋǝ ne ankɔŋ awaŋa, fe izhin yi aneshir kikin amei? Itsin mine ibǝ kɛ yi tsetser ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />ndi izhin zen shur ayi ŋub bɛr yi nyɛ Arik na ir keŋ ndi utei na ne mgbyamgbyaŋ mi te duŋǝ nyɛ andanda. Nǝ bǝn ncinces, ihwa ben kime Arik atei goŋǝ ne lu, ikime tei ren dɔ ne ŋguŋgu lu. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Fe ne miŋ kɛ klɛ mgbyamgbyaŋ ne lɛ kɛ kpa nyak maa iduŋ ta shur ayi ne ishu yayas ben goŋ mimi yayas, ikɔb kɛ aner abɛ yi tsetser ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Fena, izhineba akpa amuŋ, ndi izhin yi ne miŋ kɛ zen shur ayi ŋub nyɛ iyi Yesɔ, tsi kli zhin mgbyamgbyaŋ ndi inyɛ maa bai nyɛ yik ŋgluk nuŋ, kɔ iyik lalɛ ba se ibǝ iyi isɔŋ kɛ sik susun ben Arik. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Shuzhi zhin Arik Ŋgɔŋ amɔr ne zhɔk susun ne ta ta zhɔk, ndi zumɔr Bulus ane cɛr zhin ne Mgbemgbeb keŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Bulus ne cɛr ne nkɔŋ zhin ir keŋ ndi abɛ cɛrǝ, te bla kiki iyi zen lumɔ. Icɛr maa ihru nkan lǝlɛ yi lɔ izhi, iyiŋ ndi abɛ yi awa ben aneshir abɛ yaŋ tsǝ klɛ te aba bǝ kpur ilɛ kɛ Arik, ndi anakǝ ne cɛr iye anuŋ, ne miŋ kɛ dur men.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Neme, izhineba akpa amuŋ, ndi izhin neka men zhi amɛ, izhin bǝ hria ayi te duŋ kǝr aner abɛ yaŋ zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik abaŋa abɛ klazhin avu awa tena duŋ zhin zhaku iyaŋ yik ki didik ndi Arik ne nai aŋyak zhin ba. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Fena izhin bǝ flu ne ta zhɔk ben izhi iyi Ŋgɔŋ ben Ine ta ta zhɔk Yesɔ Kristi. Ai wa inǝk ŋgɔŋ kɛ azǝzaŋa ben iyaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>